    R2: Send me a test Invitation for a Pulse (#144)

    A Lead or Organization admin can email themselves a test of a Pulse from
    the editor: the real Invitation (marked "Test"), the real answer page, and
    nothing saved. Test tokens are their own kind (separate HMAC label and D1
    indexes), so the Submission and Participation write paths stay reachable
    only through real Invitations. 5 test sends per Person per hour. ADR 0021.

    Closes #136.


